# fuel_logging.func

> Module: fuel_logging (Yakıt Takibi) | Category: FLEET

## Purpose
Fuel consumption tracking per vehicle. Record fuel purchases with volume, unit price, and total cost. Enables fuel efficiency analysis (L/100km) and automatic syncing to expense tracking.

## Problems It Solves
- Fuel is the #1 operating cost for trucking companies
- Track fuel costs per truck for profitability analysis
- Calculate L/100km efficiency to identify underperforming vehicles or drivers
- Auto-sync fuel purchases to expense records (eliminates double entry)
- Turkish fuel market uses domestic pricing (EPDK reference)

## Technical Database Structure
**Table:** `fuel_logs`
| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | SERIAL PK | Unique identifier |
| tenant_id | INTEGER FK | Tenant isolation |
| arac_id | INTEGER FK | Linked to trucks.id |
| tarih | DATE | Purchase date |
| miktar_litre | DECIMAL(10,2) | Volume (liters) |
| birim_fiyat | DECIMAL(10,4) | Price per liter |
| toplam_tutar | DECIMAL(12,2) | Total cost (miktar * birim_fiyat) |
| km | INTEGER | Odometer at fill-up |
| created_at, updated_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | Timestamps |

**Auto-sync to expenses:** Creates expense record in `expenses` table with category YAKIT on fuel log creation.

## User Interface
**FuelLogPage.tsx** — `/dashboard/fuel-logs`
- DataGrid table: Araç, Tarih, Litre, Birim Fiyat, Toplam Tutar, KM
- Add/Edit modal with truck selector
- Auto-calculates toplam_tutar on frontend
- Delete with confirmation

## API Endpoints
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|--------|------|:---:|-------------|
| GET | `/api/tenant/fuel-logs/` | Tenant JWT | List fuel logs |
| POST | `/api/tenant/fuel-logs/` | Tenant JWT | Add log (auto-syncs to expenses) |
| PUT | `/api/tenant/fuel-logs/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Edit log |
| DELETE | `/api/tenant/fuel-logs/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Remove log |

